The Snake rules, the cycle safety planner, the prompts and questions, the policy,
the terminal UI and the game loop (laya_snake/game.py, policy.py, ui.py, cli.py)
are derived from laya_mlx/snake at that revision. Each derived file states at its
top what was changed. laya_snake/i18n.py and the disturb mode are new.

The laya-mlx NOTICE, reproduced:

